meta {
  name: GPS delete - PREVIEW (safe, deletes nothing)
  type: http
  seq: 44
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/gps
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  deviceId: 08:D1:F9:C8:4D:24
  start: 2026-10-10T15:00:00.000Z
  end: 2026-10-10T23:30:00.000Z
  preview: 1
}

docs {
  Run this FIRST. Counts the rows a real delete would remove and deletes
  nothing.

  Expect 200: { count: <n>, preview: true }
  Expect 403: ENABLE_GPS_EDIT is not set on the target server.

  Use a narrow window around what you actually want gone. Remember local
  :3000 shares the LIVE Turso DB, so a local delete is a production
  delete — there is no separate dev database.
}
